The course kit
--------------

course-kit/ is governed by its own file, course-kit/LICENSE: the documents
are CC BY 4.0, the brand/ code is MIT. That file travelled here with the kit
and is the one that grants its terms.


What is not licensed here
-------------------------

The name "Moving Parts", the three-band series mark, and the glyphs the
index draws on its course cards are not granted by either license above.
The MIT grant covers the code that draws a mark, not the mark itself.
